Subject: Jace's Machinations: let the AI cast it at the opponent's end step
Why: The card is an Effect spell with no AILogic, and EffectAi refuses any Effect spell without
  one, so even with Empower playable (0001) the AI never casts it (0 of 228 games in the
  baseline round robin). Its value is the Empower Jace 8 rider; AILogic$ AtOppEOT makes the AI
  consider it only at the end of the opponent's turn, when mana held up for counterspells is
  otherwise wasted, as a control player would.
Measured: MEASUREMENT_PENDING

